 end-0 flex items-end\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<hr data-start=\\\"7238\\\" data-end=\\\"7241\\\">\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"7243\\\" data-end=\\\"7287\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"7246\\\" data-end=\\\"7287\\\">Industries Where Wage Theft Is Common<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\n<p data-start=\\\"7289\\\" data-end=\\\"7355\\\">Some industries have <strong data-start=\\\"7310\\\" data-end=\\\"7354\\\">higher rates of wage and hour violations<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"7357\\\" data-end=\\\"7530\\\">\\n<li data-start=\\\"7357\\\" data-end=\\\"7373\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"7359\\\" data-end=\\\"7373\\\">Construction<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"7374\\\" data-end=\\\"7390\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"7376\\\" data-end=\\\"7390\\\">Food service<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"7391\\\" data-end=\\\"7406\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"7393\\\" data-end=\\\"7406\\\">Hospitality<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"7407\\\" data-end=\\\"7417\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"7409\\\" data-end=\\\"7417\\\">Retail<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"7418\\\" data-end=\\\"7441\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"7420\\\" data-end=\\\"7441\\\">Janitorial services<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"7442\\\" data-end=\\\"7482\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"7444\\\" data-end=\\\"7482\\\">Healthcare (home care workers, CNAs)<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"7483\\\" data-end=\\\"7515\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"7485\\\" data-end=\\\"7515\\\">Transportation and logistics<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"7516\\\" data-end=\\\"7530\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"7518\\\" data-end=\\\"7530\\\">Call centers<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p data-start=\\\"7532\\\" data-end=\\\"7669\\\">\\ud83d\\udccc If you work in one of these sectors, speak to <strong data-start=\\\"7581\\\" data-end=\\\"7599\\\">The Lange Firm<\\/strong> about your pay practices\\u2014especially if you\\u2019ve noticed irregularities.<\\/p>\\n<hr data-start=\\\"7671\\\" data-end=\\\"7674\\\">\\n<h2 data-start=\\\"7676\